        {
          "text": "30",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okwebeka ang’e ase Epasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia agatoma amang’ana ase Abaisraeli na ase Abayuda bonsi, naende akarika amarube ase Abaefraimu na ase Abamanase ng’a bachiche ase enyomba y’Omonene agwo Yerusalemu korenda Rituko Rinene ri’Epasaka ase Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti na abagaambi b’oborwoti bwaye, na omosangererekano bwonsi orenge Yerusalemu, konya bagambire amo korenda Rituko Rinene ri’Epasaka ase omotienyi o kabere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibarenge konyara korirenda ase engaki eria yachikiire, ekiagera abakuani konya tibarechena baisane omobaro oyoganeirie, gose abanto konya tibarasangererekana agwo Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoroberio oyio okaba omooronge ase omorwoti na ase omosangererekano bwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakararia ase Abaisraeli bonsi korwa Beeri‐Seba goika Dani ng’a, abanto bachiche Yerusalemu barende Rituko Rinene ri’Epasaka ase Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, ekiagera konya tiriana korendwa nabaanto abange buna yachigetwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abaare abaango bakaegwa amarube korwa ase omorwoti na abagaambi b’oborwoti, bakayaira ase ense yonsi y’Abaisraeli na ey’Abayuda, bagateeba buna bachigetwe nomorwoti, bagateeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Inwe Abaisraeli, moiranere Omonene, Nyasae o Aburaamu, na o Isaka, na o Israeli, erio nere nabairanere inwe abamore abatigari mwatoorekire korwa ase amaboko ’abarwoti b’Abaasuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timoba buna chisokoro chiaino na buna abanto bamino batarenge abegenwa ase Omonene, Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiabo, goika akabasiria buna morooche bono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timoba abanyabigoti bikong’u buna chisokoro chiaino chiarenge, korende mwekeyie ase Omonene, moche Aase aye Aachenu achenire kare na kare, momokorere Omonene, Nyasae oino, erinde endamwamu yaye entindi ebatige.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komorairane ase Omonene, abamino na abana baino barorerwe amaabera, na baria baboosete erio bairane ase ense eye, ekiagera Omonene, Nyasae oino, nabwate obwanchani na amaabera. Ere takobatiga ekero morairane asare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto baria abaango bairete amarube bakagenda ase kera omochie ase ense y’Efraimu na eya Manase, na goika eya Sabuloni, korende abanto bakabachecheria na kobachaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abake boka b’Aseri, na Abamanase, na Abasabuloni bagekeyia, bagacha Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ense y’Abayuda okoboko kwa Nyasae nao kwarenge kobaa ebirengererio ebimo gokora ogwancha kw’Omonene, buna omorwoti na abagaambi baria bachigete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Epasaka ekorendwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omotienyi o kabere, abanto abange mono bagasangererekana agwo Yerusalemu korenda Rituko Rinene ri’Emegati etabekiri memera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaimoka bakarusia ebisasimero biarenge agwo Yerusalemu, na ebisasimero bionsi bi’ogosambera ubani bakabirusia aroro, bakabituguta ase Rikura ria Kidironi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria ikomi na kane ri’omotienyi o kabere, bakanyenya ching’ondi chi’Epasaka. Abakuani na Abalawi bakaba nobosooku; ase igo bagechena na korenta ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa ase enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagakora emeremo yabo, kera oyomo aase aye, koreng’ana namachiiko a Musa, omonto o Nyasae. Abakuani bakanyororokeria amanyinga aria banyorete korwa ase amaboko ’Abalawi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiagera abanto abange ase omosangererekano konya tibarechena, Abalawi bakanyenya chimanwa chi’eching’ondi chi’Epasaka ase bonsi abatachenegete ase okobaatanana na kobachena ase Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abange korwa ase Abaefraimu, na Abamanase, na Abaisakaru, na Abasabuloni, konya tibarechena; korende nonya naboigo, bakaria chinyama chi’eching’ondi chi’Epasaka buna ogochika gotarenge goteeba. Hezekia konya obasabeire, ogoteeba, Omonene, ase obuya bwao ororere kera oyomo amaabera,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“oyio oonchoire enkoro yaye ase ogokorigia aye Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiabo, Omonene, nonya tachenegeti kobwatekana nomoroberio bwe Hekalu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Omonene akaigwa ogosaba gwa Hezekia, akarorera abanto amaabera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli abarenge Yerusalemu bakarenda Amatuko Amanene ay’Emegati etabekiri memera. Bagakora igo ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere, bare nomogooko omonene. Abalawi na Abakuani bakaba bagotogia Omonene rituko ase rituko, bakaba bagotera na kobugia amakano ne chinguru chiabo chionsi ase ogotogia Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia akagokia Abalawi, akababeeka chinguru ase ogokwana amang’ana ’oboremu ase bare, ase engencho y’emeremo emiya bakorete ase Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Epasaka ekorendwa naende",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abanto bakaria endagera y’omoyega oria ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere, bakarua ebing’wanso bi’omorembe, bagaakera Omonene, Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiabo, ng’a mbuya mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omosangererekano bwonsi ogancherana korenda Amatuko Amanene ase amatuko ande atano na abere; ase ayio bakayarenda ase amatuko ande atano na abere, bare nomogooko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, akaa omosangererekano chieri elifu eyemo, ne ching’ondi chikoruegwa ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa chilifu isano na ibere; na abagaambi b’oborwoti bwaye bakayoa chieri elifu eyemo, ne ching’ondi chilifu ikomi. Erio abakuani abange bagechena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omosangererekano bwonsi bw’Abayuda, na abakuani, na Abalawi, na omosangererekano bw’Abaisraeli abachete korwa ase ense yabo, na abageni abachete korwa ase ense y’Abaisraeli, na abamenyi bamenyete ase ense y’Abayuda, bakaba nomogooko omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono omogooko omonene okaba agwo Yerusalemu. Korwa ase chingaki chia Sulemani, mosinto o Daudi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, amang’ana buna ayio tana koba rinde ase Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abakuani na Abalawi bagatenena, bagasesenia abanto, na amariogi abo akaigugwa, na ogosaba kwabo kogaika ase obomenyo obochenu Omonene aaria igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
